incorporation_legal_framework.pro_forma_first_board_resolution_en:
RESOLVED, that the articles of incorporation, as filed with the Registraire des entreprises in accordance with the Business Corporations Act (Quebec), are hereby approved and ratified;
RESOLVED FURTHER, that the directors accept the subscription for 100 common shares at CAD 1.00 per share, issued to the sole subscriber for professional secretarial contracts;
RESOLVED FURTHER, that the registered office as set out in the articles is adopted and the nominated first director is appointed as President and Secretary;
RESOLVED FURTHER, that the officers are authorized to effect all statutory registrations, open corporate banking accounts, and appoint a registered agent for service, effective immediately.
